WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:14.997
"I have to get to Metro City Central Bank," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:15.017 --> 00:00:17.338
"Somebody is robbing it!"

3
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:20.721
She ran over to Mr.

4
00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:23.182
Green. "Mr.

5
00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:24.563
Green," said Roxy.

6
00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:26.425
"I just remembered something.

7
00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:30.728
Principal Penn wanted to, um, talk to me."

8
00:00:31.592 --> 00:00:33.473
"Go ahead, Roxy," said Mr.

9
00:00:33.513 --> 00:00:38.734
Green. A moment later Roxy shot through the air.

10
00:00:38.754 --> 00:00:41.335
"Look!" cried Mara.

11
00:00:42.035 --> 00:00:43.175
"Rocket Girl!"

12
00:00:45.236 --> 00:00:46.376
Terrell scratched his head.

13
00:00:46.396 --> 00:00:47.917
"Where did Roxy go?"

14
00:00:50.137 --> 00:00:52.058
Roxy arrived at Metro City Central Bank.

15
00:00:53.298 --> 00:00:54.898
Police cars surrounded the building.

16
00:00:56.619 --> 00:00:58.199
The bank's front doors were smashed.

17
00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.240
Smoke poured out of them.

18
00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:03.201
A crowd of people stood across the street.

19
00:01:06.564 --> 00:01:07.424
"Rocket Girl!"

20
00:01:07.624 --> 00:01:08.585
called Detective Smith.

21
00:01:09.606 --> 00:01:11.187
Roxy flew over to the detective.

22
00:01:11.207 --> 00:01:15.750
"Are you trying to deposit a check, Detective?"

23
00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:16.651
Roxy grinned.

24
00:01:17.771 --> 00:01:18.892
Detective Smith frowned.

25
00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.174
"This isn't funny, Rocket Girl.

26
00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:23.936
A robbery is taking place!"

27
00:01:23.956 --> 00:01:26.798
"I know," said Roxy.

28
00:01:26.818 --> 00:01:29.820
"Is the bank robber still in the bank?"

29
00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:32.381
Detective Smith nodded.

30
00:01:32.401 --> 00:01:33.322
"I think so."

31
00:01:34.722 --> 00:01:35.843
"Do you know who he is?"

32
00:01:36.204 --> 00:01:36.864
asked Roxy.

33
00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:40.166
A woman in the crowd stepped forward.

34
00:01:40.186 --> 00:01:43.829
"Do you mean 'what' he is?"

35
00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:46.331
Roxy was confused.

36
00:01:46.351 --> 00:01:49.753
"I saw the robber," said the woman.

37
00:01:50.734 --> 00:01:52.995
"He looks like a giant machine!"

38
00:01:53.015 --> 00:01:56.258
"It's true," said a man in a suit.

39
00:01:57.579 --> 00:01:59.160
"He's covered in big, heavy armor.

40
00:01:59.816 --> 00:02:01.217
He looks like an army tank!"

41
00:02:02.599 --> 00:02:04.400
"Hmm," said Detective Smith.

42
00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:09.704
"This must be connected to the crime at Metro City army base."

43
00:02:09.725 --> 00:02:12.647
"What happened at the army base?"

44
00:02:12.927 --> 00:02:13.588
asked Roxy.

45
00:02:13.608 --> 00:02:17.051
"Somebody stole a tank," said the detective.

46
00:02:17.071 --> 00:02:19.393
"It happened a couple of nights ago."

47
00:02:19.413 --> 00:02:22.115
"I'm coming out!"

48
00:02:22.295 --> 00:02:24.157
shouted a deep voice from inside the bank.

49
00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:27.940
"Everybody better stay out of my way!"

50
00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.981
Detective Smith picked up a megaphone.

51
00:02:31.001 --> 00:02:33.201
"The bank is surrounded.

52
00:02:33.881 --> 00:02:35.382
Come out with your hands up!"

53
00:02:36.682 --> 00:02:39.343
"Ha-ha!" The deep voice laughed.

54
00:02:39.363 --> 00:02:45.885
"My name is Hank Tank, and I'm the toughest criminal in Metro City.

55
00:02:46.965 --> 00:02:48.486
Nobody can stop me.

56
00:02:49.606 --> 00:02:52.707
I'm coming out now with all the money I stole."

57
00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.908
Roxy heard heavy footsteps inside the bank.

58
00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.742
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

59
00:03:03.343 --> 00:03:04.724
The building and street shook.

60
00:03:05.865 --> 00:03:07.646
People ran in all different directions.

61
00:03:07.666 --> 00:03:11.169
"The robber is coming out!"

62
00:03:11.429 --> 00:03:12.110
shouted a woman.

63
00:03:13.571 --> 00:03:14.992
"Run for your lives!"

64
00:03:15.232 --> 00:03:15.853
cried a man.

65
00:03:16.994 --> 00:03:18.095
Detective Smith gulped.

66
00:03:18.115 --> 00:03:21.357
"Hank Tank sounds pretty big."

67
00:03:22.658 --> 00:03:24.400
"Yeah." Roxy nodded.

68
00:03:25.741 --> 00:03:26.822
The footsteps stopped.

69
00:03:27.722 --> 00:03:29.444
For a moment everything was quiet.
